in, check it moves to first position (newest moved). We already restored big(1) and it's in Media. Trash currently has huge (IrisSeed) and hughugeQ (Beta). Let's re-trash big(1) and verify it appears first. That's a good repetition/sorting test.\n\nDo it: currently in Albums landscape. Rotate portrait? Not necessary; but navigate. Tap Media bottom. Then open big(1).jpg, delete. Then check trash first item is big (1). Then compare with the other items' original order. But all moved times now differ (big(1) newest). If big(1) appears first, sorting by move time correct. If it appears last (original date 11:40), bug. Let's test.\n\nSwitch to portrait first for reliable taps."}
