uld disappear. If a stale card remains with the deleted cover, that's the cache bug! Let's test. We can restore after.\n\nIrisSeed huge card [4] (portrait). Open it, delete huge, back to grid. Check if IrisSeed card gone. Then restore huge. This is a clean cover-cache invalidation test. Let's do it. Currently in Settings; press Back to Albums (Settings back). Then follow.\n\nSteps:\n- Press Back (element 28) to Albums.\n- Tap IrisSeed huge [4].\n- Open huge, Delete.\n- Back to grid, observe.\n- Go Trash, restore huge.\n- Back to grid, observe.\n\nThis is also a good repetition/state test. Let's do."}
